<% photo = page_photo("about") %>
<section class="page-hero <%= "has-photo" if photo %>" <% if photo %>style="<%= hero_photo_style(photo) %>"<% end %>>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Las Vegas</p>
    <h1>Family owned and owner operated</h1>
    <p class="lede">A truck and trailer shop in Las Vegas for owner-operators, fleets, and drivers passing through.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <h2>The shop</h2>
      <% if (shop = shop_photo("about")) %>
        <%= image_tag shop, alt: "Work in the Trucks of Nevada shop", class: "about-photo" %>
      <% end %>
      <p>For more than ten years, we've taken care of drivers who need a clear diagnosis and, when the job can be finished, a truck back the same day.</p>
      <p>Our mechanics are ASE certified. We work on Volvo, Freightliner, Kenworth, International, Peterbilt, Mack, box trucks, diesel-powered motorhomes, and cranes: engines, electrical, transmissions, trailers, aftertreatment, inspections, and maintenance.</p>
      <p>We don't do tires, alignment, or body work. We'll tell you that on the phone, so you don't drive across town for a job we don't take.</p>
      <%= phone_link "Call Now (702) 333-2463", class: "btn-call" %>
    </div>
    <ul class="check-list">
      <li>Family owned and owner operated</li>
      <li>ASE-certified mechanics</li>
      <li>Same-day repairs when we can finish the job</li>
      <li>24/7 roadside within about 100 miles</li>
      <li>Shop hours Monday–Friday, 8:30am–5:30pm</li>
      <li>1260 Rockpebble Ave, North Las Vegas</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
